We'll just wait here
while you make a decision.

00:08:56.201 --> 00:08:58.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
- You all right?
- Yeah, I'm just getting
  bitten by all these bugs.

00:08:58.036 --> 00:09:00.139 align:start position:0%
Oh, it's all right.
Don't worry about it.

